1
00:00:02,627 --> 00:00:05,007
(Howard:)Ooh, more details
about the new Star Trek film.

2
00:00:05,171 --> 00:00:09,341
(Howard:)There's going to be a scene
depicting Spock's birth.

3
00:00:09,509 --> 00:00:13,099
(Raj:)I'd be more interested in a scene
depicting Spock's conception.

4
00:00:13,763 --> 00:00:19,273
(Sheldon:)Oh, please. For Vulcans, mating,
or, if you will, Pon farr...

5
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:22,686
(Sheldon:)- ...it's an extremely private matter.
- I'd like to know the details.

6
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:25,986
(Leonard:)His mother was human. His father
was Vulcan. They couldn't conceive.

7
00:00:26,151 --> 00:00:29,191
(Howard:)Maybe they had to go to a clinic.
Can you imagine Spock's dad...

8
00:00:29,362 --> 00:00:33,072
(Howard:)...with a copy of
Pointy Ears and Shapely Rears?

9
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,410
(Raj:)How come on Star Trek
everybody's private parts are the same?

10
00:00:37,579 --> 00:00:42,209
(Raj:)No alien lady ever told Captain Kirk,
"Hey, get your thing out of my nose."

11
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:43,457
[KNOCKS ON DOOR]

12
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:45,417
Hi. Can you help me?

13
00:00:45,587 --> 00:00:47,877
(Penny(entering):)I was writing an e-mail
and the A key got stuck.

14
00:00:48,048 --> 00:00:50,718
Now it's just going, "Aaaah."

15
00:00:51,051 --> 00:00:53,221
- What'd you spill on it?
- Nothing.

16
00:00:54,262 --> 00:00:55,552
(Penny:)Diet Coke.

17
00:00:56,806 --> 00:00:58,806
And yogurt.

18
00:00:58,975 --> 00:01:00,225
And a little nail polish.

19
00:01:00,393 --> 00:01:02,023
(Leonard:)I'll take a look at it.

